      "description": "Golf carts for sale at wholesale prices across Florida statewide. Inventory updated daily. New and used golf carts from Club Car, EZGO, Yamaha, Denago, Evolution and more. 0% APR financing. Nationwide delivery. Call 1-888-840-4490.",
